//! {{ crate_name }} - Binary entry point
//!
//! Command-line interface for {{ crate_description }}.
//!
//! ## Architecture
//!
//! This binary uses clap-noun-verb's auto-discovery to register commands
//! from the library crate. No explicit command registration needed.
//!
//! ```text
//! main.rs (this file)
//!    ↓
//! {{ crate_lib }}::run()  (auto-discovers all #[verb] commands)
//!    ↓
//! CommandRegistry (collects distributed_slice entries)
//!    ↓
//! CommandRouter (dispatches parsed args to handlers)
//! ```

