/// Main entry point
///
/// Initializes the CLI framework and auto-discovers all `#[verb]` commands.
///
/// # Exit Codes
///
/// * 0 - Success
/// * 1 - Validation error (invalid arguments or user input)
/// * 2 - Execution error (I/O, network, external service failure)
/// * 3 - Configuration error (missing files, permissions, env vars)
/// * 101 - Internal error (panic or unwrap, should never happen)
///
/// # Examples
///
/// ## Basic usage
///
/// ```bash
/// # List help
/// $ app --help
///
/// # List available nouns and verbs
/// $ app --list-commands
///
/// # Execute a verb
/// $ app {{ example_noun }} {{ example_verb }} [ARGS]
/// ```
///
/// ## Common patterns
///
/// ```bash
/// # PLACEHOLDER: Add example commands
///
/// # Example: Create a resource
/// $ app {{ example_noun }} create "my-resource"
///
/// # Example: List resources with output formatting
/// $ app {{ example_noun }} list --format yaml
///
/// # Example: Delete with confirmation
/// $ app {{ example_noun }} delete "my-resource" --force
/// ```

